| Domain | Framework | Identified Failure | Real-World Harm |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Prompting** | **AIM** | Lack of **Intent** specificity; models were asked to "assess risk" without cultural context. | Rejection of valid informal traders who don't follow Western financial patterns. |
| **Fluency** | **4D** | Poor **Delineation** of data sources; LLMs hallucinated loan terms not found in our policy. | Users entered debt traps based on incorrect interest rate information provided by the chatbot. |
